  "description": "Arkcon welcomes you to our recently renovated two bedroom property to let on the ever popular Kelly's Court. Please email your enquiry. Phone call enquires are not accepted due to high volume demand. We aim to respond to all enquiries, however this may not be possible. Thank you for your understanding. The one-bedroom apartment in Kelly's Court, Dublin 1, has been fully renovated to a modern, turnkey standard throughout. It features a bright open-plan living and dining area with new wood-effect flooring and a sleek fitted kitchen complete with contemporary cabinetry, integrated appliances, and a tiled splashback. The double bedroom includes custom-built wardrobes offering ample storage, while the bathroom has been fully refitted with stylish tiling, a walk-in shower, and high-quality sanitaryware. Freshly painted walls, updated lighting, and new interior doors complete the finish, creating a clean, elegant living space that feels fresh and modern. Kelly's Court is ideally located for tenants seeking convenience and city living. Situated just off Dorset Street in Dublin 1, it offers easy access to the city centre, Parnell Street, and O'Connell Street, all within a short walk. The area is well served by frequent bus routes and is close to Drumcondra train station, providing excellent transport links across Dublin. Tenants benefit from a wide choice of nearby shops, cafés, gyms, and restaurants, as well as proximity to major companies, universities, and hospitals. The neighbourhood has a lively yet practical atmosphere, making it particularly appealing for all residents who want to live close to the city's amenities. Please email your enquiry to make this property your own. References and documents are required by all applicants. Available early November. Bills are not included in the monthly rent. Thank you.",
